              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "JDVMD"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I don't like to use meat tenderizer so I subbed seasoning salt and fresh cracked pepper. Simple and good. With tenderloin, you don't have to get fancy -- you want that great flavor of the beef to shine through and this is one way to do just that.",
